{"id":"vod_sn_38598","vodId":"38598","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"变身！偶像公主","name_cn":"变身！偶像公主","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/cb1a3ac92d9a2485689c492d62667a0d.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一个名为“童话王国”的魔法世界之中，替这个世界供给能量的，是漂浮在天空上的幸福之星。糟糕的是，近日里，幸福之星接二连三的消失了，如果这样的情况继续下去，那么童话王国总有一天会消失不见。为了避免这样的情况发生，女王决定派出三个魔法宠物前往人间，他们要找到有资格成为偶像公主的三名少女，委托她们帮助童话王国收集幸福之星。这三人便是雪森苹果、高城蕾拉和笹原名月。　　在魔法的加持之下，三名少女得以暂时拥有长大成人的模样，她们通过她们的歌声和舞蹈给人们带来幸福快乐，因为变身维持的时间非常的短暂，所以她们也被人们称为“谜一样的美少女偶像公主”。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:02:57","playable":true,"episodeCount":51,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7G6ewiqRJ41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5SF9nGrHqh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/k89yRnTKgZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/F9VzTnTJqR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tMMhkrJ77N1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HsgKkxgxds1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rpXhZGc2R91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6dkqnnZfH71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mpjaT5Zah51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fnWdKc76ac1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SsFqsVMJad1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/79BZC5zJFs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/55rMEKJ5Cn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aDUD4N85ja1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"h